      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tasfique Khan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108420251554873555906/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV44WTomyreBe0aokS3z7FnBHixWBMG3BVIixVXdYegM6NrBGo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Let me start by saying that out of all my years of dealing with insurance agents / brokers / companies. This has been by far one of the best experiences I’ve had… David Montgomery, you’ve done an amazing work! Efficient, seamless, great coverage and good price. If you’re a real estate investor with multiple properties, multi-res, commercial.. commercial vehicles or other commercial insurance needs reach out to him. He’ll do his best, pull all the strings and get the job done. Looking forward to more business togheter in the future! Thank you for all your work!",
        "time": 1738391911,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "DiAnne Giguere",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105446706310077855721/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWfQ7naKrOHhO-VaDW3nQUdA3gxyzq7UxFyAeQ5hWDXuvzOAbfb=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "When you call you get to speak to a \"real\" person.  It is easy to get service in Englisg, they are always so pleasant.  I have had a claim and Promutuel was very quick to respond and dealt with claim.3",
        "time": 1741368423,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alex",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109331597020500756802/reviews",
